   186	/// Applies the modeled implicit block-entity component from a placed item.
   187	///
   188	/// `BlockItem.updateBlockEntityComponents` calls
   189	/// `BlockEntity.applyComponentsFromItemStack` before `setPlacedBy` and the block-place game
   190	/// event; randomizable containers apply their `ContainerLoot` component as the vanilla
