     1	//! Inventory slot implementations.
     2	//!
     3	//! This module defines the [`Slot`] trait and its implementations. Slots represent
     4	//! individual positions in an inventory that can hold items.
     5	//!
     6	//! # Slot Types
     7	//!
     8	//! - [`NormalSlot`] - A basic inventory slot with no restrictions
     9	//! - [`ArmorSlot`] - An armor slot that only accepts appropriate item types
    10	//!   (helmets in head slot, chestplates in chest slot, etc.)
    11	//!
    12	//! # Slot Operations
    13	//!
    14	//! Slots support various operations:
    15	//! - Getting/setting the item stack
    16	//! - Checking if items can be inserted
    17	//! - Taking items from the slot
    18	//! - Marking the slot as changed (dirty)
    19	//! - Callbacks for slot interaction events
