   488	/// insertion to `ItemTags.BEACON_PAYMENT_ITEMS`, and `getMaxStackSize` caps it at 1. The
   489	/// same restriction is duplicated on the anonymous `SimpleContainer`'s `canPlaceItem`
   490	/// override backing the slot (`BeaconMenu.java:26-36`).
