  2650	/// Runs `Mob.serverAiStep` at the `LivingEntity` AI/movement boundary.
  2651	///
  2652	/// Vanilla reaches this after `LivingEntity.aiStep` has prepared input and before jump,
  2653	/// travel, and collision effects. Keeping the selector/navigation/controller phase here
  2654	/// lets the generic living tick place it correctly for every mob implementation.
  2655	pub(crate) fn tick_mob_ai<'a>(
